---
import Layout from '@layouts/Layout.astro';
const title = 'How to Use Didi in China as a Foreigner';
const description = 'Set up and use DiDi (China\'s Uber) without a Chinese phone number. Ride options, payment, and tips.';
---

<Layout title={title} description={description} lang="en">
  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-12">
    <nav class="mb-8 not-prose">
      <a href="/en/transport/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm text-gray-400 hover:text-gray-700 transition no-underline group">
        <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 transition-transform group-hover:-translate-x-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 19l-7-7 7-7"/>
        </svg>
        Back to Transport
      </a>
    </nav>
    <header class="mb-12">
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-3">🚗 Ride-Hailing</p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 mb-4 leading-tight">
        How to Use Didi in China as a Foreigner
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 mb-6">Set up and use DiDi (China's Uber) without a Chinese phone number. Ride options, payment, and tips.</p>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 text-sm text-gray-500">
        <span>📅 Last updated: June 2026</span>
        <span>⏱️ 5 min read</span>
      </div>
    </header>

    <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-50 to-indigo-50 border-l-4 border-blue-500 rounded-r-2xl p-8 mb-12 not-prose">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-blue-900 mb-4">🎯 Quick Answer</h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-blue-800 leading-relaxed">
        You can use DiDi <strong>without a Chinese phone number</strong>. The easiest way is through the Alipay or WeChat mini-program — open the app, search for DiDi, and book a ride. Payment goes through Alipay/WeChat automatically. The standalone DiDi app also has an English version.
      </p>
    </div>

    <nav class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-8 mb-12 not-prose">
      <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">📋 In This Guide</h3>
      <ul class="space-y-3">
        <li><a href="#alipay" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">📱 Method 1: Through Alipay or WeChat (Easiest)</a></li>
        <li><a href="#app" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">📲 Method 2: Download the DiDi App</a></li>
        <li><a href="#rides" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">🚘 Ride Types</a></li>
        <li><a href="#tips" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">💡 Tips for Using DiDi</a></li>
        <li><a href="#uber" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">🔀 What About Uber?</a></li>
      </ul>
    </nav>

    <div class="prose prose-gray max-w-none">

      <h2 id="alipay" class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">📱 Method 1: Through Alipay or WeChat (Easiest)</h2>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">If you already have Alipay set up (see the <a href="/en/payment/setup-alipay/" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">Alipay setup guide</a>):</p>

      <ol class="list-decimal pl-6 space-y-4 text-gray-700 mb-8">
        <li>Open Alipay or WeChat</li>
        <li>Scroll down to "Mini Programs" (or search for "DiDi")</li>
        <li>Tap the DiDi mini-program</li>
        <li>Allow location access</li>
        <li>Set your pickup and destination, choose a ride type, and confirm.</li>
      </ol>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mb-8 not-prose">
        <div class="bg-gray-100 rounded-xl p-3">
          <div class="text-xs font-bold text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-wide mb-2">Alipay</div>
          <img src="/images/didi/alipay-didi.jpg" alt="Accessing DiDi through Alipay mini program" class="w-full rounded-lg border border-gray-200">
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 italic mt-2">Find DiDi in Alipay's mini program list</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-gray-100 rounded-xl p-3">
          <div class="text-xs font-bold text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-wide mb-2">WeChat</div>
          <img src="/images/didi/wechat-didi.jpg" alt="Accessing DiDi through WeChat mini program" class="w-full rounded-lg border border-gray-200">
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 italic mt-2">Search for DiDi in WeChat's mini programs</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">Payment goes through Alipay or WeChat automatically. No Chinese phone number needed.</p>

      <hr class="my-10 border-gray-200" />

      <h2 id="app" class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">📲 Method 2: Download the DiDi App</h2>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">The DiDi app has an English version. Download it from your app store (search "DiDi Rider"). You can register with an international phone number and switch the interface to English in settings.</p>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">Payment methods: Alipay, WeChat Pay, Visa/Mastercard (add in-app).</p>

      <hr class="my-10 border-gray-200" />

      <h2 id="rides" class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">🚘 Ride Types</h2>

      <ul class="space-y-2 text-gray-700 mb-8">
        <li><strong>Express (快车):</strong> Standard ride, cheapest. Comparable to UberX.</li>
        <li><strong>Premier (优享):</strong> Slightly nicer cars, a bit more expensive.</li>
        <li><strong>Taxi (出租车):</strong> Hails a regular taxi through the app. Pay the meter rate digitally.</li>
        <li><strong>Luxury (豪华车):</strong> High-end cars (Mercedes, BMW). Expensive.</li>
        <li><strong>Hiring a Car (包车):</strong> Book a driver for multiple hours or a full day.</li>
      </ul>

      <hr class="my-10 border-gray-200" />

      <h2 id="tips" class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">💡 Tips for Using DiDi</h2>

      <ul class="space-y-2 text-gray-700 mb-8">
        <li><strong>Set your pickup accurately:</strong> Drag the pin on the map to exactly where you're standing. Drivers often can't find you if the pin is off.</li>
        <li><strong>Check the license plate:</strong> Match the plate number in the app to the car.</li>
        <li><strong>Use the in-app chat:</strong> It has built-in translation for communicating with your driver.</li>
        <li><strong>Be patient:</strong> In busy areas, your driver might be a few minutes away.</li>
        <li><strong>Tolls:</strong> Highway tolls and airport fees are added to your fare automatically.</li>
      </ul>

      <hr class="my-10 border-gray-200" />

      <h2 id="uber" class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">🔀 What About Uber?</h2>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">Uber sold its China operations to DiDi in 2016. The Uber app still works in China but only for international travelers, and driver availability is limited. DiDi is the default ride-hailing service — you'll get faster pickups and better coverage.</p>

    </div>

    <div class="not-prose mt-16">
          <div class="border-t border-gray-100 pt-6 mt-8">
      <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-50 to-blue-50 border border-brand-100 rounded-xl p-5 not-prose">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4 flex-wrap">
          <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-gray-900">📚 Next Reads</h3>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
